{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_05",
  "title": "Invitation to the Ball",
  "storyCode": "SS-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "40189a8d5cd93ac2afa0ede17d252d06b22b5b90881d1445f81b7c88ede14837",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*... Guh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Muffled noises echo through the empty cavern. Somewhere nearby, excavators continue their endless digging.\nThe air is colder and colder."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The moment she's out of the cavern, a chill sets in.\nBut it merely spurs on her heart to run faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How... How do I face her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She cannot word it. She cannot face it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tut tut tut. Whatever will you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko does not need to turn her head to know who it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now this girl's dreamland, I'm rather satisfied with!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sweet dreams for every child are the duty of the Castle of Dreams, and I've granted each one of her wishes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Honestly, I'm surprised how smoothly this dream runs—no, flawlessly, in fact. Beyond my wildest expectations."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, things have gotten even more interesting now, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...You're deceiving her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, no, no, nothing of the sort. We've had plenty of dealings, she and I. She knows full well what I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, seeing these results just fills my heart with joy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She knows it's all a dream and she still doesn't want to leave! Isn't that the very proof my dreamspinning is unmatched?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Corettons",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Chirping in agreement)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, you coming here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now that's interesting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morpheus",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I'll leave you two to it, then! I trust you'll soon discover just how amusing this dream really is, Sakiko Togawa."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko. Everyone's waiting for you. Let's go back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Morpheus just vanished in front of you. Aren't you the least bit surprised...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everything here, we imagined together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'We'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... aren't a part of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi's Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You play guitar so well, Mutsumi-chan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saki..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. Mum... Where did Saki go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi's Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saki-chan? Maybe she just went off somewhere...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, no. Saki... Saki would never abandon me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cheering crowd suddenly goes deathly quiet. They all stare straight at Mutsumi."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi's Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mutsumi-chan, you seem to have forgotten—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi's Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This isn't just your dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi's Mother'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is 'our' dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Us'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In this dream, every 'Mutsumi' has the chance to make her wish come true."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Together with Mutsumi-chan, we've built a sweet dream that's ours and ours alone—where everyone can dream of happiness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We exist in Mutsumi-chan's mind. We've seen her life countless times over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the end, we unanimously agreed that this—is the best ending for all the 'Mutsumis'—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you, Sakiko Togawa, are the enemy of this dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mutsumi, what are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want you to suffer either, but we shouldn't hide away in dreams like this—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, Mutsumi-chan gets to live a happy life here. That's the most important thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not like the others. I want to talk things out with you, Sakiko."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can stay here with me, and we'll protect Mutsumi-chan's sweet dream together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's a fragile child. Odds are she still can't decide whether she wants to wake, or to stay here in bliss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So long as you choose to stay as well, and help us keep this dream going, it'll naturally become 'reality'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are the sole determiner of 'reality' here. You <i>are</i> reality."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So. Stay with us, Sakiko."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I refuse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... refuse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In <i>reality,</i> Mutsumi's body is lying out in the cold in the Castle of Dreams. Can you accept that as an ending, too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you truly love her, you would not be doing this to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as Mutsumi-chan is happy, as long as we can exist—what does it matter what's reality or not?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have Mutsumi-chan's every memory! I know your heart's deepest desire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you'll just stay here, I can even give you a whole, entire Ave{@nbs}Mujica!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shut up! You're not Mutsumi at all... She would never say that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I like you, and I like Mutsumi-chan..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why are you forcing me to choose like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An unidentified voice hovers above their heads."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The distant mountains seem to shake. The gravel on the ground jostles to a rhythm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There's no one around to be seen, but Sakiko can almost feel countless gazes boring into her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're right. To Mutsumi-chan, we are her countless shadows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So that the shadows may hide forever in the darkness, even the weakest light must be snuffed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Step by tiny step, 'Mutsumi' forces Sakiko towards a precipice."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What are you doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "'Mutsumi' reaches out, placing her hand on Sakiko's shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko loses her balance. 'Mutsumi's' figure grows smaller and smaller."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want Mutsumi-chan to be happy forever, Sakiko. I also don't want the 'Mutsumis' to have to disappear anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just have no choice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mutsumi-chan... doesn't need you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Mutsumi'",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Goodbye forever, Sakiko."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
